   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Fatima. Your identity is verified.\n\nI checked order Q-8101 from Green Bowl, and I'm not able to cancel it. The courier picked it up at 7:27 PM, so it's already on its way to you. The app still says \"preparing,\" but the courier's record is the accurate one. Orders can only be cancelled before pickup.\n\nHere's what I can see:\n- **Items:** 2 \u00d7 Harvest bowl, 2 \u00d7 Lemonade\n- **Promised delivery:** 7:40 PM\n- **Delivery address:** 400 Summit Ave, Oakdale, CA 94611\n- **Total charged:** $43.61 to your Visa ending in 4242\n\nSince you won't be home, you may want to contact the courier directly or arrange for someone to receive the order. If you tell me where you'd like it to go, I can check whether the address can be changed, but that also depends on the order not having been picked up, so it likely can't be changed now either.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "The app said preparing the whole time, so I didn't think it had gone out yet. I still can't be home for it, though. Can you tell me if there's any way to get my money back for it instead?"
