  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry, I know that's not the answer you wanted. I can't refund this order because it doesn't meet our refund conditions. Refunds are only available when an order is cancelled before pickup, when items are missing or wrong, or when the order was never delivered and the courier didn't reach you. A change in plans isn't one of those cases, and this order has already been picked up.\n\nHere's what you can do:\n- **Contact the courier** through the app to arrange a different drop-off spot, such as a neighbor, a building front desk, or a safe place outside your door, if the courier allows it.\n- **Have someone else receive the order** at 400 Summit Ave.\n- **Report a problem after delivery.** If the order doesn't arrive, arrives late, or has missing or incorrect items, contact us within 48 hours of handoff and we'll review it under our policy.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I understand. It's a bit frustrating since the app said preparing the whole time, but I'll try to get someone to take it or ask the courier about a drop-off spot. Thanks for checking."
